_summary":"The task is fully satisfied. Direct before-and-after observations demonstrate an online expansion from 1.00 GiB to 2.50 GiB without unmounting or altering the verification payload. The mandatory node-restart evidence is complete and independently consistent with the lifecycle boot identities.","limitations":["The generic lifecycle snapshots do not independently inventory LVM or mount state; those outcomes rely on the coherent executor command captures."]}
